        "question": "What is the mechanism of sweet taste receptor?",
        "options": {
            "A": "Gq coupled receptor",
            "B": "Gustducin through IP3 pathway",
            "C": "Direct Na+ channel opening",
            "D": "cGMP mediated pathway",
